@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Income Tax Ordinance [New Version] (פקודת מס הכנסה [נוסח חדש]), row IL-27: ss 39A, 39B, 40A to 40F, 41, 44, 45, 46 to 46C, 47A;
-- s 35(e) with the rules of 5738-1977; s 47(d) with the Regulations of 5740-1980; and the Retirement Age Law 5764-2004
-- (the retirement age that ITO s 1 and s 37 take).
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module of this row imports this one.
--
-- Sources: ../../registers/source-bundle/income-tax-ordinance-new-version.he.wiki.txt (sha256 b87f2cf4...94b81b6) and, beside
-- it, regulations/income-tax-credit-for-immigrants-special-cases-rules-5738-1977.he.wiki.txt (260b2b8b...186c3),
-- regulations/income-tax-deduction-of-payments-for-benefits-or-pension-regulations-5740-1980.he.wiki.txt (1de85699...34240) and
-- ../../../retirement-age-law-5764-2004/registers/source-bundle/retirement-age-law-5764-2004.he.wiki.txt (633aa70f...1dfa1bd).
-- Hebrew Wikisource raw MediaWiki, unofficial consolidations. A `src:N` comment quotes line N of the Ordinance; an
-- `ext:[TAG:N]` comment quotes line N of another source (tag reg35, reg47 or ral); both are generated by tools/srcquote.py.
--
-- Money is new Israeli shekels (NIS), a bare NUMBER, for a whole tax year unless a name says otherwise.
-- Membership test: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the fact, or a register, a certificate, a return or a
-- recorded determination records it. Whether it gives a credit or a deduction is a rule and belongs in the section module.
--
-- NAMES. Type names end in the section they serve ("..., for section 40C"), so they cannot be confused with the records of
-- rows IL-01 to IL-08. Rows IL-01 to IL-08 declare `tax year`, `an Israeli resident in the tax year` and `a foreign worker`
-- as fields; this row spells them the same way.

§ `Nouns for row IL-27 of the Income Tax Ordinance`

§§ `Facts common to several sections`

-- "גבר", "אישה": the Law of 5764-2004 and sections 39A and 40A speak of a man and a woman; the sex on the person's record.
DECLARE `A person's sex, for these sections` IS ONE OF
    `a man`
    `a woman`

-- A section that gives a credit says elsewhere "יחיד תושב ישראל" (s 34, 40(a), 40(b), 40C, 40D, 44, 45) but ss 39A, 39B,
-- 40A, 40B and 41 name no residence condition. Fork F1 of this row.
DECLARE `A reading of the sections that name no residence condition (ss 39A, 39B, 40A, 40B)` IS ONE OF
    `no residence condition`
    `an Israeli resident only`
    `declined where residence decides`

-- Sections 44 and 45 let the Minister make regulations setting conditions for the credit. The regulations of 5756-1996 are
-- not in the source bundle (see ito-il27-published-figures.l4 for the Wikisource note that mentions them).
DECLARE `Whether the conditions of the regulations made under a section are met` IS ONE OF
    `met`
    `not met`
    `not known`

§§ `Section 39A: a discharged soldier`

-- src:1609 | סעיף 39א – זיכוי לחייל משוחרר [תיקון: תש״ס, תשס״ז, תשס״ז־6]
-- src:1610 | בחישוב המס על הכנסתו מיגיעה אישית של חייל משוחרר תובא בחשבון חלק מנקודת זיכוי לכל חודש משלושים וששה החודשים הראשונים שלאחר החודש שבו סיים את שירותו הסדיר, כמפורט להלן:
-- src:1617 | לענין זה, ”חייל משוחרר“ ו”שירות סדיר“ – כהגדרתם בחוק קליטת חיילים משוחררים, התשנ״ד–1994.
-- The Discharged Soldiers Absorption Law is not in the source bundle: whether one is a discharged soldier, and the full months
-- of his regular service, are facts the caller states.
DECLARE `A discharged soldier in a tax year, for section 39A` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `sex`                                                                            IS A `A person's sex, for these sections`
    `a discharged soldier within the Discharged Soldiers Absorption Law`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `full months of regular service`                                                 IS A NUMBER
    `calendar year in which he ended his regular service`                            IS A NUMBER
    `calendar month in which he ended his regular service`                           IS A NUMBER  -- 1 to 12
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Section 39B: a combat reservist`

-- src:1619 | סעיף 39ב – זיכוי בעד שירות מילואים כלוחם [תיקון: תשפ״ו]
-- src:1620 | (א) בחישוב המס לשנת המס של יחיד ששירת שירות מילואים כלוחם בשנת המס שקדמה לה (להלן – שנת המס הקודמת), יובאו בחשבון נקודות זיכוי כמפורט להלן:
-- src:1627 | (ב) בסעיף זה –
-- src:1628 | ”לוחם“ – לפי פקודות הצבא כהגדרתן בחוק השיפוט הצבאי, התשט״ו–1955;
-- src:1629 | ”שירות מילואים“ – כהגדרתו בחוק שירות המילואים, התשס״ח–2008.
-- A fighter and reserve service are defined in two Laws not in the source bundle; the days of reserve service as a fighter in the
-- previous tax year are a fact the caller states.
DECLARE `A combat reservist in a tax year, for section 39B` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `days of reserve service as a fighter in the previous tax year`                  IS A NUMBER
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

-- The lines marked "(הוראת שעה בשנים 2026 ו־2027)" sit among paragraphs (1) and (2); how they relate to those paragraphs the
-- text does not say. Fork F2 of this row.
DECLARE `A reading of the temporary provision of section 39B` IS ONE OF
    `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027`
    `paragraphs (1) and (2) govern in every tax year`
    `declined where the readings differ`

§§ `Section 40A: a divorced individual who has married again`

-- src:1648 | סעיף 40א – נקודת זיכוי לגרוש שנשא אשה אחרת [תיקון: תשל״ז, תשמ״ח־3, תשנ״ב־6]
-- src:1649 | בחישוב המס של גרוש שהוא או בן־זוגו משלם מזונות לבן זוגו לשעבר, והוא נשוי לבן־זוג אחר, תובא בחשבון נקודת זיכוי אחת.
DECLARE `A divorced individual in a tax year, for section 40A` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `sex`                                                                            IS A `A person's sex, for these sections`
    `a divorcee`                                                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `he or his spouse paid maintenance to his former spouse in the tax year`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `married to a spouse other than the former spouse`                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

-- "גרוש" is the masculine form, and the heading says "אשה אחרת"; the body says "בן־זוג". Fork F3 of this row.
DECLARE `A reading of "divorcee" in section 40A` IS ONE OF
    `a divorced man only`
    `a divorced person of either sex`
    `declined where the individual is a woman`

§§ `Section 40B: a youth`

-- src:1651 | סעיף 40ב – נקודת זיכוי לנער [תיקון: תשמ״א־8, תשנ״ב־6]
-- src:1652 | בחישוב המס של יחיד שמלאו לו או לבן־זוגו 16 שנים אך לא 18 שנים תובא בחשבון נקודת זיכוי.
DECLARE `An individual and a spouse, for section 40B` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of birth of the individual`                                                IS A DATE
    `date of birth of the spouse`                                                    IS A MAYBE DATE
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

-- "16 שנים אך לא 18 שנים": at what time in the tax year the age is measured, the text does not say. Fork F4.
DECLARE `A reading of "has completed 16 years but not 18" in section 40B` IS ONE OF
    `on the last day of the tax year`
    `on some day of the tax year`
    `on every day of the tax year`
    `declined where the readings differ`

§§ `Sections 40C, 40D and 40E: studies`

-- src:1654 | סעיף 40ג – נקודות זיכוי ליחיד שסיים לימודים לתואר אקדמי [תיקון: תשס״ה־9, תשס״ז־5, תשע״ב־4, תשע״ג־2, תשע״ו־7, תשע״ח־4]
-- src:1673 | סעיף 40ד – נקודת זיכוי ליחיד שסיים לימודי מקצוע [תיקון: תשס״ה־9, תשס״ו, תשע״ג־2, תשע״ו־6, תשע״ז־6, תשע״ח־4]
-- A credit is a number of points for a run of tax years; the credit in a tax year is the sum of the entitlements that cover it.
DECLARE `A run of credit points` HAS
    `points`                                                                         IS A NUMBER
    `first tax year`                                                                 IS A NUMBER
    `number of tax years`                                                            IS A NUMBER

-- 40C(a), (d): a first degree, a second degree, a third degree in medicine or dentistry, or a direct track to a third degree.
DECLARE `A kind of academic studies, for section 40C` IS ONE OF
    `a first academic degree`
    `a second academic degree`
    `a third academic degree in medicine or dentistry`
    `a direct track to a third academic degree`

-- (ג1): a degree in a field of occupation that requires an internship, completing the degree being a condition of the internship.
DECLARE `An internship, for section 40C(c1)` HAS
    `calendar year in which the internship began`                                    IS A NUMBER
    `calendar year in which the internship ended`                                    IS A NUMBER

-- The text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022 lets the individual elect the year in which the point is counted.
DECLARE `The election of the year in which a point is counted, in the text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022` IS ONE OF
    `the tax year after the tax year in which the studies ended`
    `the tax year after that`
    `the tax year after the tax year in which the internship ended`

DECLARE `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `kind of studies`                                                                IS A `A kind of academic studies, for section 40C`
    `entitled to the degree from a higher education institution`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `years of academic study`                                                        IS A NUMBER
    `tax year in which the studies ended`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `for a direct track, years of study for the first degree`                        IS A NUMBER
    `for a direct track, tax year in which the studies for the first degree ended`  IS A NUMBER
    `a certificate of completion and of entitlement was given to the assessing officer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `internship`                                                                     IS A MAYBE `An internship, for section 40C(c1)`
    `elected to count the point from the tax year after the internship`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `election in the text for 2014 to 2022 graduates`                                IS A `The election of the year in which a point is counted, in the text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022`
    `election for the second point of a third degree in the text for 2014 to 2022 graduates` IS A `The election of the year in which a point is counted, in the text for those who finished studies in 2014 to 2022`
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

-- (ד)(1) says one point "in three tax years" and half a point "in two tax years", both "starting" in the year after; whether the
-- two runs overlap or follow one another the text does not say. Fork F5.
DECLARE `A reading of section 40C(d)(1), the point and the half point` IS ONE OF
    `the two runs start together`
    `the half point follows the point`
    `declined where the readings differ`

DECLARE `An individual's vocational studies, for section 40D` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `hours of study, counted as the hours customary at a higher education institution` IS A NUMBER
    `entitled to a certificate recognised by a government ministry`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `years of vocational study`                                                      IS A NUMBER
    `tax year in which the studies ended`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `proof of completion and of entitlement was given to the assessing officer`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `election in the text for 2018 to 2022 graduates`                                IS A BOOLEAN  -- TRUE: the second tax year after the studies ended
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:1683 | סעיף 40ה – מניעת כפל [תיקון: תשס״ה־9, תשס״ז־5, תשע״ז־6]
DECLARE `The choice under section 40E` IS ONE OF
    `the points of section 40C`
    `the point of section 40D`

§§ `Section 41: a spouse who was married for part of the tax year`

-- src:1689 | סעיף 41 – בן זוג שהיה נשוי חלק מהשנה [תיקון: תשכ״ה, תשכ״ח, תשל״ג, תשל״ד־2, תשל״ה־2, תשל״ו, תשל״ט־3, תשנ״ב־6]
DECLARE `A spouse married for part of the tax year, for section 41` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `a registered spouse`                                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `months of the tax year in which he was not married`                             IS A NUMBER
    `months of the tax year in which he was married`                                 IS A NUMBER
    `months of the tax year in which he was married for part of the month`           IS A NUMBER
    `credit points for the whole year under sections 34, 36, 40(b) and 40B, as if not married` IS A NUMBER
    `credit points for the whole year under section 66, as if married`               IS A NUMBER

-- "שבהם לא היה נשוי": a month in which he was married for part only is in neither list on its face. Fork F6.
DECLARE `A reading of a month in which he was married for part, for section 41` IS ONE OF
    `a month in which he was married`
    `a month in which he was not married`
    `a month of neither`
    `declined where the readings differ`

§§ `Sections 44 and 45: a relative kept in an institution; a disabled child`

-- src:1703 | סעיף 44 – זיכוי בעד הוצאות החזקת קרוב במוסד [תיקון: תשל״ה־2, תשל״ז, תשל״ח־5, תשל״ט־3, [ק״ת סכומים], תשמ״ז, תש״ן־4, תשנ״ב־6, תשנ״ה־7, תשע״ז־5, תשע״ז־11]
DECLARE `A taxpayer who paid to keep a relative in an institution, for section 44` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `sums he or his spouse paid in the tax year to keep a qualifying relative in a special institution` IS A NUMBER
    `taxable income`                                                                 IS A NUMBER
    `the conditions of the regulations made under section 44`                        IS A `Whether the conditions of the regulations made under a section are met`
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:1707 | סעיף 45 – זיכוי בעד נטולי יכולת [תיקון: תשל״ז, תשל״ח־5, תשל״ט־3, תשמ״ח־3, תשנ״ה־7, תשס״ג־3, תשע״ז־11]
DECLARE `A child, for section 45` HAS
    `paralyzed`                                                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `blind`                                                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `has an intellectual-developmental disability`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `a tax credit was received for the child under section 44`                       IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Whose computation takes the points of section 45` IS ONE OF
    `the individual's`
    `the spouse's`
    `not stated`

DECLARE `An individual with children, for section 45` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an Israeli resident in the tax year`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the individual's or the spouse's children in the tax year`                      IS A LIST OF `A child, for section 45`
    `has a spouse`                                                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `whose computation takes the points`                                             IS A `Whose computation takes the points of section 45`
    `the conditions of the regulations made under section 45(d)`                     IS A `Whether the conditions of the regulations made under a section are met`
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Sections 46 to 46C: donations`

-- src:1744 | סעיף 46 – תרומה למוסד ציבורי [תיקון: תשכ״ב־2, תשכ״ח־2, תשל״ג, תשמ״ד־10, תשמ״ז, תש״ן, תשנ״ב־5, תשנ״ג־4, תשנ״ד, תשס״א־2, תשס״ה־4, תשס״ה־9, תשס״ז־3, תש״ע, תשע״ב־9, [ק״ת הודעות]]
-- The institution being one "שקבע לענין זה שר האוצר באישור ועדת הכספים" is a recorded determination: a fact the caller states.
DECLARE `Amounts excess donated in earlier tax years and not yet credited, for section 46` HAS
    `from one tax year earlier`                                                      IS A NUMBER
    `from two tax years earlier`                                                     IS A NUMBER
    `from three tax years earlier`                                                   IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `A donor in a tax year, for section 46` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `an individual, and not a body of persons`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `donations in the tax year, each to a national fund or to an institution the Minister of Finance has determined` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
    `taxable income`                                                                 IS A NUMBER
    `carried in`                                                                     IS A `Amounts excess donated in earlier tax years and not yet credited, for section 46`
    `the rate fixed in section 126(a), for a body of persons`                        IS A NUMBER

-- The two amounts the section prints, adjusted by s 120B: the minimum donation and the absolute ceiling.
DECLARE `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year` HAS
    `the sum a donation must exceed`                                                 IS A NUMBER
    `the absolute ceiling on donations credited in a tax year`                       IS A NUMBER

-- "סכום העולה על 207": the year's donations together, or each donation. Fork F7.
DECLARE `A reading of "donated a sum exceeding" the minimum, in section 46(a)` IS ONE OF
    `the donations of the year together`
    `each donation on its own`
    `declined where the readings differ`

-- src:1753 | סעיף 46א – תקרה כוללת להטבות מס לתרומות ולמו״פ [תיקון: תשמ״א־3, תשמ״ד־10, תשנ״ד]
DECLARE `Donations and research and development in a tax year, for section 46A` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `taxable income before the deduction for participating in research and development` IS A NUMBER
    `sums on which a credit for donations under section 46 is given`                 IS A NUMBER
    `sums deducted for participating in research and development under section 20A and the Law of 5744-1983` IS A NUMBER

-- Which is cut when the total passes the ceiling, the text does not say. Fork F8.
DECLARE `A reading of the cut under section 46A` IS ONE OF
    `the credit is cut first`
    `the deduction is cut first`
    `declined where the total passes the ceiling`

-- src:1756 | סעיף 46ב – זיכוי בשל תרומה – תוספת לבסיס המקדמות [תיקון: תשמ״א־3, תשמ״ד־10]
-- src:1760 | סעיף 46ג [תיקון: תשמ״א־3, תשמ״ד־10]

§§ `Section 47A: National Insurance contributions`

-- src:1791 | סעיף 47א – ניכוי בשל תשלומי ביטוח לאומי ומס מקביל [תיקון: תשל״ה, תשל״ה־2, תשל״ז־3, תשמ״ד־2, תש״ן־4, תשנ״ו־3, תשנ״ז, תשפ״ג־5]
DECLARE `National Insurance contributions in a tax year, for section 47A` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `contributions paid in the tax year on income that is not work income`           IS A NUMBER
    `contributions paid in the tax year on work income, his employer not being liable to pay for him` IS A NUMBER
    `additions under section 179(a) of the National Insurance Law included in those contributions` IS A NUMBER
    `refund received in the tax year of contributions overpaid in an earlier year, without any addition under section 362` IS A NUMBER
    `taxable income before the deduction`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `sums paid in the tax year for medical insurance, other than dental, to a body the Minister of Finance determined` IS A NUMBER

-- (b1) opens "על אף האמור בסעיפים קטנים (א) ו־(ב)"; whether the cap of (a), the taxable income before the deduction, survives it. Fork F9a.
DECLARE `A reading of the cap of section 47A(a) in subsection (b1)` IS ONE OF
    `the cap of subsection (a) applies`
    `the cap of subsection (a) does not apply`
    `declined where the cap decides`

-- (c) speaks of the Parallel Tax Law, which (d) confines to periods ending on 31 December 1996. Fork F9.
DECLARE `A reading of section 47A(c) after 1996` IS ONE OF
    `subsection (c) lapses with the Parallel Tax Law`
    `subsection (c) survives`
    `declined where medical insurance sums were paid`

§§ `Section 35(e): the rules of 5738-1977`

-- ext:[reg35:16] | בכללים אלה, ”קטין“ – מי שטרם מלאו לו 18 שנה.
DECLARE `A person who left Israel and returned, for rule 2 of the rules of 5738-1977` HAS
    `date of birth`                                                                  IS A DATE
    `was an immigrant, and the day he became one`                                    IS A MAYBE DATE
    `months he stayed in Israel in total after becoming an immigrant, before 31 March 1977` IS A NUMBER
    `received for his income in that period an exemption under section 9(16) or credit points under section 35` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the day he left Israel`                                                         IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the day he returned to Israel`                                                  IS A MAYBE DATE

-- The rules do not say from which day one treated as an immigrant counts. Fork F10.
DECLARE `A reading of the day from which one treated as an immigrant under rule 2 counts` IS ONE OF
    `the day he returned to Israel`
    `the day he first became an immigrant`
    `declined`

-- Rule 3 leaves out, at his request, regular service under the Security Service Law and a period of post-secondary study. Whether
-- it reaches the 54 months for one who immigrated from 2022 on, the rule (which says 42) does not say. Fork F11.
DECLARE `A reading of "the 42 months" in rule 3 of the rules of 5738-1977` IS ONE OF
    `rule 3 reaches the 54 months as well`
    `rule 3 reaches only the 42 months`
    `declined where the readings differ`

DECLARE `A period left out of the count of months under rule 3` HAS
    `first calendar month`                                                           IS A DATE
    `number of months`                                                               IS A NUMBER

-- An immigrant whose credit is counted under the rules, in a tax year: the day from which the months count (the day of immigration, or for one
-- treated as an immigrant under rule 2 the day the reading names), the months of the tax year resided in Israel as calendar month numbers 1-12
-- (s 35(c)), and the periods rule 3 leaves out. Rows IL-08's `An immigrant in a tax year, for section 35` holds one absence under s 35(c); a
-- period left out under that subsection is entered here as a period too.
DECLARE `An immigrant counted under the rules of 5738-1977, in a tax year` HAS
    `tax year`                                                                       IS A NUMBER
    `the day from which he counts as an immigrant`                                   IS A DATE
    `months of the tax year in which he resided in Israel`                           IS A LIST OF NUMBER
    `periods left out of the count of months`                                        IS A LIST OF `A period left out of the count of months under rule 3`
    `a foreign worker`                                                               IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Section 47(d): the Regulations of 5740-1980`

-- ext:[reg47:19] | שעור הניכוי לפי סעיף 47(ב) לפקודה בשל תשלומים בעד תגמולים או קיצבה שזכאי לו יחיד שמלאו לו בתחילת שנת המס 50 שנה, יהיה –
DECLARE `An individual's age and kind of payment, for the Regulations of 5740-1980` HAS
    `date of birth`                                                                  IS A DATE
    `paid for a pension only`                                                        IS A BOOLEAN

-- The readings of the regulations, each a fork of this row: F12 the ceiling of the deduction ("the product of the rates fixed
-- in s 47(b)(1) or (2)"), F14 whether the regulations replace s 47(b) or only add to it. (F13, whether paragraph (b) keeps s 47(b)(2)'s
-- second limb, is no fork on row IL-08's definitions: that limb is never the lower; NOTES.md.)
DECLARE `A reading of the ceiling of the deduction in regulation 1` IS ONE OF
    `the first rate of the paragraph`
    `every rate of the paragraph`
    `declined where the readings differ`

DECLARE `A reading of regulation 2 against section 47(b)` IS ONE OF
    `the regulation replaces the rate of section 47(b)`
    `the individual has the higher of the two`
    `declined where the readings differ`

DECLARE `The readings of the Regulations of 5740-1980` HAS
    `ceiling`                                                                        IS A `A reading of the ceiling of the deduction in regulation 1`
    `against section 47(b)`                                                          IS A `A reading of regulation 2 against section 47(b)`

§§ `The Retirement Age Law`

-- ext:[ral:42] | הגיל שבהגיעו אליו זכאי אדם לפרוש מעבודתו בשל גילו ולקבל, בהתקיים התנאים הקבועים לכך על פי דין או הסכם, גמלה בשל פרישתו מעבודתו כאמור, הוא גיל 67 לגבר וגיל 65 לאישה (בחוק זה – גיל הפרישה).
DECLARE `A person, for the Retirement Age Law` HAS
    `sex`                                                                            IS A `A person's sex, for these sections`
    `calendar year of birth`                                                         IS A NUMBER
    `calendar month of birth`                                                        IS A NUMBER  -- 1 to 12
